<title>UK: Christiania Bank sets $150 million May 1999 FRN.</title>
<headline>Christiania Bank sets $150 million May 1999 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHRISTIANIA BANK OG KREDITKASSE</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.MAY.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    06.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  100.01    FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A+	  REOFFER    100.01</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
